WEBVTT

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.500
I arrived too late again.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.010
Little bugs who have never seen the sky...

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:43.350
Rush across the land on a journey...

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:50.980
Down an endless road...

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:57.660
That you found in a dream...

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:05.040
Little birds who have never seen the sea...

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:11.460
Take flight and ride the wind...

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:19.160
Embrace a love that echoes...

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:25.880
Deep inside your heart...

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:28.610
President Faria!

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.000
Ellen. Any sign of successors?

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.720
None that I could see.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:38.990
I see...

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.480
The funeral is complete.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.380
Let's move on to our next post.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:29.200
<b>Awakening\h\h\h-Succession-</b>

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.880
You okay?

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:46.030
I swear... I <i>will</i> save you.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.880
Student Council President!

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:57.040
Up ahead, Ulley Village is on fire!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.550
Physis is here, too?

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.010
Then the new students...

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.930
We don't know that for sure yet.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.330
This time...

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.530
I <i>will</i> save you!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.440
They're here, too?

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:26.360
H-Help me!

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.740
It's coming this way!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:56.040
<i>They kill people to increase their numbers?</i>

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.700
This way's blocked, too.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.080
Maybe the station?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:20.290
How did it all come to this?

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.110
Maybe there's something 
I can use in here...

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.120
I guess I'm done for...

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.220
There's no way a train's coming.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.340
No escape, huh?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.260
Thank goodness.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.880
There are still people alive!

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.760
President, what shall we do?

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.410
Maintain speed.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.560
You withdraw to the safety zone!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.850
<i>Understood.</i>

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.820
<i>The usual, then?</i>

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.580
Yes, the usual.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.270
This is a battle for the Seven Knights!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.270
Are you all right?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.590
Who are you?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.050
Get back!

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.110
<i>She took the hit for me?</i>

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.200
Stay away!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.510
It seems magic alone won't be enough.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.460
What is that?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:27.210
In the name of Goddess Serrass! 
Knight Eunomia, answer my call!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.840
Succession!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.640
That's from Granseed...

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.240
Roar, Blue Lightning!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.240
You shall not lay a hand on him!

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:08.880
You okay?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.330
Yes... I'm just fine.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.480
I'm glad.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:17.800
Wait a minute... Are you a new 
student at Granseed Academy?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.390
I'm Nemo.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:21.770
I'm Faria Barcelos.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:28.490
I'm so glad... I could save at least you.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:44.970
Um...

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.540
What's that smell?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.800
Coffee.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.300
Do you not care for it?

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.920
Um...

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.800
I've actually never had it.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:58.070
I see. I think you'll like it, though.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.310
It's all the rage in the capital these days.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:01.750
Try some.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.180
Thank you.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:08.690
It's bitter!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.260
Sorry.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:11.940
You can add sugar.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.200
Your injuries... aren't too bad?

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.480
Not at all. I'm used to this.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.310
Why...

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.690
Why did you protect me back there?

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.090
You even got hurt...

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.590
Is it so strange?

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:39.910
I couldn't save the people of that village.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:43.350
So I'm glad I was at least 
able to protect you.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:45.980
Me?

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.640
Is something the matter?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.490
I was just thinking about
 how they're all dead.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.430
Your village isn't the only one.

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:03.740
Five towns in the region have 
been swallowed by the darkness.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:09.660
Fighting those monsters 
is the power of Granseed...

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.580
My hero vanquished worshipers 
of the God of Destruction

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.510
during the Great Dark Age
 and saved the world.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.230
Her name is Eunomia.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:32.360
Long ago, our world was driven 
to the brink of ruin by Evil God Nestra.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:36.780
But the heroes chosen by 
the goddess kept the world safe.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:41.780
And those who still wield those
 heroes' powers... are their successors.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:47.040
Yes. The students of Granseed Academy.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.750
We have a duty to protect 
the world from Physis,

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.040
a cult that worships the God of Destruction.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.960
A school that protects the world, huh?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.650
You'll be a student yourself 
starting tomorrow, won't you?

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.680
It doesn't feel real yet.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:23.660
I only applied because someone 
told me I had potential...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.670
We all feel that way at the start.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:29.160
We never really know what we're 
truly capable of, after all.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.340
What I'm capable of?

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.580
I have no idea...

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:38.480
You might even become 
the strongest of us all.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:41.550
What's going on?!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.740
President! We have a serious problem!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.130
Faria!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.270
You shielded me again...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.200
I told you...

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:38.270
I'll save at least you.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.640
But I also...

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.040
Don't worry.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:50.040
It would take much worse to end my fight.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:06.810
I am the leader of the Seven Knights!

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.390
I can handle this!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.390
You can't! You're in no condition to—

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.530
I-Incredible.

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:28.870
Eliminated!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.780
<i>It's still so powerful...</i>

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.280
I will...

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:18.910
Nemo!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.420
You leave me no choice!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.720
Eunomia! Turn thy rage into a cage of light!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.060
Flee!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.480
The next station should be just a mile away.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.750
Take Ellen and run!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.070
What are you going to do?

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:52.450
I came to Granseed knowing 
it might be the death of me.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.430
But...

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:01.750
Just listen!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.880
It's best to save as many people as possible.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.660
But that means <i>you'll</i> die!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:10.880
So what's the point?!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.760
You're still just a candidate.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.890
If you stay, you'll die, too!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.110
I...

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:24.900
What is this?

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.030
That light... Is it possible?!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.780
What is this place?

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.320
Thou who art guided...

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.040
Who art thou?

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.050
Me?

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:47.820
My name's Nemo.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:52.050
Where... Where am I?

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.710
I have to go back!

00:15:56.690 --> 00:16:00.810
How mysterious, always, 
is the guidance of fate...

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.740
I am Goddess Serrass,

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:09.000
guardian of this garden and its newest deity.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.400
Declare unto me thy heart's desire.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.320
Power!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.790
Enough power that I won't 
have to abandon her!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.230
Then thou needst pay a fair price.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:26.080
I have nothing to offer but my life.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:31.780
Thou wouldst give thine own life 
for a girl so recently met?

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:36.000
Wherefore dost thou seek this?

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.600
I don't know. I don't know!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.520
But I don't want to run.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.200
I don't want to abandon her.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.650
I don't know the reason why,

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.730
but I still...

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.230
The stars hath offered their guidance.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:56.150
I acknowledge thy resolve to walk the 
narrow path of atonement and strife.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:05.000
Thou already hast the 
power that thou seeketh.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:18.010
You share the same spark 
that lies within our souls.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.510
Who are you?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.750
Let us begin.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:24.010
Our sacred duty is to save others.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:50.960
You...

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.210
I did it!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:57.340
<i>Wield thy heart's desire.</i>

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.720
Why is your arm like that?

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:02.360
I've never seen a succession like this.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.350
Or is his contract...

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.720
<i>Worry not. He is a friend.</i>

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.110
Lady Eunomia?

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.550
<i>Have faith, Faria.</i>

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:15.100
<i>He is a fine hero.</i>

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.790
Outta my way!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.440
Amazing.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:37.050
It's an incomplete succession, 
yet he has so much power.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:41.280
<i>Her weapon...</i>

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.260
Faria!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.630
Can you fight now?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.260
Yes. Are you all right?

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:18.720
I don't know.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.840
But I think I can fight.

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:23.260
Please let me fight!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.020
Very well. Let us fight together, Nemo.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:30.200
As Granseed comrades-in-arms.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.080
Listen.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.250
Synchronize yourself with your hero.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.650
Make your will as one.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.780
Our will as one...

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.010
They're not tools to be brandished.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.720
They're souls who act in tandem with you.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.790
Sense their intent and turn that into power.

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.590
<i>If you can hear my voice...</i>

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.990
<i>I shall aid you.</i>

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.380
<i>Your desire is my desire.</i>

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:02.290
You keep it in check.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.300
I'll finish it off.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.910
I...

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.830
<i>Wield thy heart's desire.</i>

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.430
My heart's desire?

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.410
I want...

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.740
Take this!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.200
<i>Faria!</i>

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:30.900
Goddess Serrass...

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.210
Have mercy on this pitiful beast!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.440
Thank you, Nemo.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.950
It seems you saved my life this time.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.100
I... saved your life?

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:15.770
What? Won't you shake my hand?

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.460
Am I really worthy?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.540
Of course you are.

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:28.240
Thank you as well.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.980
I look forward to working with you, Nemo.

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:14.450
This is Granseed Academy?

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:16.460
Yes.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:21.140
The very school where 
you'll be studying with us.

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.880
Welcome to Granseed Academy!

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.010
You're one of the Seven Knights?

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:31.520
I'm as shocked as you are.

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:32.110
You bastard!

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:34.800
The president is too kind.

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Chance Encounter -Granseed-</b>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:36.100
Next time: "Granseed."

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:39.210
A new door is opening.
